  "evaluation_notes": [
    "Expected concepts describe semantic requirements. any_of contains illustrative target-language phrases, not an exhaustive list of valid translations.",
    "Phrase matching is diagnostic triage only. A missing phrase is not automatically a semantic failure; human review should record meaning, negation, pronouns, count and direction.",
    "Forbidden phrases flag likely errors in the supplied context, not universal forbidden translations. Review their surrounding negation before assigning failure.",
    "These scenarios include no asserted model results. Report actual output, latency and reviewer decision separately."
